sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    C->>W: Click "Book" (the network is slow)
    W->>A: POST booking, Idempotency-Key = K1
    A->>D: Save appointment + key K1 (same transaction)
    D-->>A: Saved
    A--xW: Response lost on the way
    W->>A: Retry: POST booking, Idempotency-Key = K1
    A->>D: Key K1 seen before, same request
    A-->>W: 201 Created: the SAME appointment
    Note over A,D: Only one appointment exists.<br/>Same key with a different body: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
